ind":"update","title":"v1.0.8 Small Patch - Achievement Progress Fix","summary":"Hey everyone!v1.0.8 is live. This is a small patch focused on one thing: achievement progress.Bug FixFixed the “Ultimate Collector” achievement progress going down or resetting after selling parts or restarting the game. Your collection progress is now kept safely and can no longer decrease.Good to knowThe progress bar in your Steam library can take a little while to refresh. If it looks outdated, restarting Steam usually updates it.Parts you collected before this fix may not all be counted. If ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T16:21:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933893","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4265160-1846018067931652","game_id":"steam-4265160","kind":"announcement","title":"V1.0.7 IS LIVE!","summary":"Hey everyone!v1.0.7 IS LIVE. This one is all about comfort and polish, with new options, quicker selling and a long list of fixes. Thanks to everyone who reported bugs!New FeaturesHead Bobbing option in Gameplay settings (on by default)Show Hand option in Gameplay settings (on by default)Sell parts and blades with R (moved from Ctrl + Right Click)Sell placement boxes with R, with a confirmation panel showing the item name and priceLeave the cashier with ESC as well as TUnderground entrance light","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T23:24:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4265160-1846018067925798","game_id":"steam-4265160","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Out: Time to Hit the Arena!","summary":"DEMO IS OUT!On behalf of the entire Releaseplay Studio team, a massive thank you! Seeing so many players gearing up for our game is a huge motivation for us, and the moment has finally arrived.The first demo for SteelBlade Shop Simulator is now live on Steam!Be sure to join our Discord community to share your thoughts after playing and chat directly with the dev team. Every single wishlist helps boost our visibility on Steam and is the biggest support you can give us right now.Stay sharp, keep t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:17:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925798","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4265160-1842846814443295","game_id":"steam-4265160","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for 2,500 Wishlists!","summary":"On behalf of the entire Releaseplay Studio team, a massive thank you! Seeing so many players gearing up for our game is a huge motivation for us. Every single wishlist helps boost our visibility on Steam and pushes the development forward.We are currently working hard to polish the core mechanics, refine the Japanese street environments, and make sure every arena clash feels impactful and satisfying.If you haven't already, be sure to join our Discord community to get early sneak peeks, share you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T13:27:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4265160-1826992588603445","game_id":"steam-4265160","kind":"announcement","title":"SteelBlade Shop Simulator Official Discord is Open!","summary":"Hello, Bladers! 🛠️We are incredibly excited to announce that the doors to our Official Discord Server are now open! This is the place where we will build the world of SteelBlade Shop Simulator together, exchange ideas, and hang out.Listening to our community's voice is super important to us as we develop the game. We can't wait to hear all your suggestions—from the new top parts you want to craft and sell, to your thoughts on the spinning mechanics.Why Should You Join?Share Your Ideas: What do y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-17T10:45:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588603445","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4265160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:08:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:08:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4265160":"2026-10-26T02:08:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4265160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:08:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:08:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5256050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:08:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:08:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4265160","app_id":4265160,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:31Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"46b48449d6bc193d5879c18f3b88a346ee1a4fde87df3a7c0aad1e521c6fe199","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"SteelBlade Shop Simulator lets you run your own SteelBlade shop in the streets of Japan. Open SteelBlade boxes, collect parts with different tiers, build powerful SteelBlades, sell them for profit, or take them into the arena and compete to prove your skill.","publishers":